## -----------------------------------------------------------------
## siri.ttl — SIRI base vocabulary (UNOFFICIAL PLACEHOLDER)
## -----------------------------------------------------------------
## Status:    UNOFFICIAL PLACEHOLDER.
##
## This file reserves the SIRI base-vocabulary slot in the two-file
## layout that mirrors nordic-netex-ontology (netex.ttl +
## netex-nordic.ttl):
##
##     siri.ttl        ← SIRI base vocabulary   (this file)
##     siri-nordic.ttl ← Nordic SIRI Profile
##
## There is currently NO canonical, CEN-published RDF/OWL ontology
## for the SIRI standard. NeTEx is in the same situation: netex.ttl
## in nordic-netex-ontology is likewise a placeholder — the only
## existing formal source is an old, outdated Transmodel ontology.
## Until a canonical base is established under CEN
## (https://siri-cen.eu/), this placeholder exists only to:
##   1. Hold the `https://siri-cen.eu/ontology#` namespace, and
##   2. Give siri-nordic.ttl a stable base to build on.
##
## The Nordic SIRI Profile (siri-nordic.ttl) presently self-contains
## the base terms it needs. Do NOT treat this file as an authoritative
## SIRI vocabulary. When CEN publishes an official base ontology, this
## placeholder should be replaced by (or aligned with) that source.
## -----------------------------------------------------------------

@prefix siri:  <https://siri-cen.eu/ontology#> .
@prefix owl:   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos:  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd:   <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<https://siri-cen.eu/ontology> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "SIRI base vocabulary (unofficial placeholder)" ;
    owl:versionInfo "placeholder-0.1" ;
    rdfs:comment "UNOFFICIAL placeholder for a CEN-published SIRI base ontology. See siri-nordic.ttl for the Nordic SIRI Profile." ;
    skos:definition "Reserves the SIRI base-vocabulary slot until a canonical ontology exists in CEN." ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://siri-cen.eu/> .

## -----------------------------------------------------------------
## END OF PLACEHOLDER
## -----------------------------------------------------------------
